flowchart LR
  Identity[Workload identity] --> Driver[Approved secret driver]
  KMS[Cloud KMS / secret manager] --> Driver
  Driver -->|read-only source| Stage[non-root init container]
  Stage -->|regular 0400 file in memory volume| API[zeus-api Pod]
  API -->|Local AES-256-GCM| PG[(PostgreSQL ciphertext)]
  API --> Gateway[Egress gateway]
  Gateway -->|destination allowlist| Approved[OIDC / Model / KMS / telemetry]
  API -->|OTLP| Collector[OTel Collector]
